 "text": "Hi, how have you been these last few months? Lovely. Retrievers are great dogs for ear picnics. Is he used to bags of treats and bowls? No problem. So, the dog. Bage him around parks No, it's tonight. I got rebooked, and I overslept. Anyhow, the dog. He's good with leaves and birds, but nervous of other dogs. He won't come when called if he wants to chase. No worries. A nice walk without other dogs is good too. He' learn he can enjoy the park without the chase.",
